OL,5,G1700 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FDocumentary series following an
OL,7,     FEssex police unit. A drug dealer's
OL,8,     Fcar flashes up on the police
OL,9,     Fradar, leading to a risky
OL,10,     Finterception.
OL,11,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FIn this episode the high-speed
OL,13,     Fpolice unit are in hot pursuit of
OL,14,     Fa transit van and later rescue a
OL,15,     Fman from an overturned tractor in
OL,16,     Fthe Essex countryside.
OL,17,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FHand-picked officers of the Essex
OL,19,     FPolice force tackle some of the
OL,20,     Fmost dangerous criminals in the
OL,21,     Fcountry. In this episode car
OL,22,     Fthieves steal a BMW.
