OL,5,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe interceptors go after car
OL,7,     Fthieves who are attempting to flee
OL,8,     Fthe country with a stolen BMW.
OL,9,     FMeanwhile, it's the end of the
OL,10,     Fline for some burglary suspects in
OL,11,     FSouthend.
OL,12,G2100 Trauma Room One
OL,13,     FSurgeons race to remove a
OL,14,     Flife-threatening brain mass from
OL,15,     F34-year-old Milton, operate on
OL,16,     FAnnie's spinal tumour to prevent
OL,17,     Fparalysis, and perform complex
OL,18,     Fkeyhole surgery on Rob's spine.
