OL,5,G2200 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,6,G     Death
OL,7,     FSurgeons face a challenge as
OL,8,     FSusan's cancer spreads from her
OL,9,     Fjaw to her eye and nose. Removing
OL,10,     Fit will leave a significant hole
OL,11,     Fin her face, needing complex
OL,12,     Freconstruction.
OL,13,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,14,     FThe staff of Hull Royal Infirmary
OL,15,     Fis shocked when a young man is
